msgid ""
"Select whether or not to overwrite data for dates in the calendar that "
"already contain information. Selecting \"Overwrite\" will add all events "
"present in the iCal file, regardless of the existing information for the "
"calendar dates. Selecting \"Skip\" will add data only for dates that do not "
"have any information set."
